name: ['Abomination of Llanowar', "Ambition's Cost", 'Angel of Finality', 'Angel of Serenity', 'Arcane Artisan', 'Arcane Signet', 'Azorius Chancery', 'Azorius Guildgate', 'Azorius Signet', 'Banishing Light', 'Beast Whisperer', 'Bounty of Skemfar', 'Brago, King Eternal', 'Burnished Hart', 'Casualties of War', 'Cleansing Nova', 'Cloudblazer', 'Cloudgoat Ranger', 'Command Tower', "Commander's Sphere", 'Cosmic Intervention', 'Crown of Skemfar', 'Cryptic Caves', 'Cultivator of Blades', 'Curse of the Swine', 'Day of the Dragons', 'Dwynen, Gilt-Leaf Daen', 'Eerie Interlude', 'Elderfang Venom', 'Elvish Archdruid', 'Elvish Mystic', 'Elvish Promenade', 'Elvish Rejuvenator', 'Empyrean Eagle', 'End-Raze Forerunners', 'Ethereal Valkyrie', 'Evangel of Heliod', 'Eyeblight Cullers', 'Eyeblight Massacre', 'Farhaven Elf', 'Flickerwisp', 'Foul Orchard', 'Geist-Honored Monk', 'Ghostly Flicker', 'Ghostly Prison', 'Goldnight Commander', 'Golgari Findbroker', 'Golgari Guildgate', 'Golgari Rot Farm', 'Harvest Season', 'Hero of Bretagard', 'Imperious Perfect', 'Inspired Sphinx', 'Jagged-Scar Archers', 'Jungle Hollow', 'Kor Cartographer', 'Lathril, Blade of the Elves', 'Llanowar Tribe', 'Lys Alana Huntmaster', 'Lys Alana Scarblade', 'Marble Diamond', "Marshal's Anthem", 'Marwyn, the Nurturer', 'Masked Admirers', 'Meandering River', 'Meteor Golem', 'Miara, Thorn of the Glade', 'Migratory Route', 'Mind Stone', 'Mist Raven', 'Mistmeadow Witch', 'Moldervine Reclamation', 'Momentary Blink', 'Mulldrifter', 'Myriad Landscape', 'Nullmage Shepherd', 'Numa, Joraga Chieftain', 'Opal Palace', 'Pact of the Serpent', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Poison-Tip Archer', 'Pride of the Perfect', 'Prowess of the Fair', 'Putrefy', 'Ranar the Ever-Watchful', 'Reclamation Sage', 'Restoration Angel', 'Return to Dust', 'Rhys the Exiled', 'Ruthless Winnower', 'Sage of the Beyond', 'Sea Gate Oracle', 'Sejiri Refuge', "Serpent's Soul-Jar", 'Shaman of the Pack', 'Sky Diamond', 'Sol Ring', 'Soulherder', 'Spectral Deluge', 'Springbloom Druid', 'Stoic Farmer', 'Storm Herd', 'Sun Titan', 'Swiftfoot Boots', 'Sylvan Messenger', 'Synthetic Destiny', 'Tales of the Ancestors', 'Thunderclap Wyvern', 'Timberwatch Elf', 'Tranquil Cove', 'Twinblade Assassins', 'Voice of Many', 'Voice of the Woods', 'Wall of Omens', 'Whirler Rogue', 'Windfall', 'Wirewood Channeler', 'Wolverine Riders', 'Wood Elves']
